1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,500
Little Moments.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,375
The Not-So-Lost Remote.

3
00:00:03,375 --> 00:00:05,469
We are ready for a nature show.

4
00:00:05,469 --> 00:00:10,490
The snacks are ready, the lights are low, and the television is off because the remote has disappeared.

5
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:12,625
Dad checks the coffee table.

6
00:00:12,625 --> 00:00:14,583
I check under a magazine.

7
00:00:14,583 --> 00:00:16,594
Ben checks his snack bowl.

8
00:00:16,594 --> 00:00:18,677
Why would it be in your snack bowl?

9
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:20,682
I like to be thorough.

10
00:00:20,908 --> 00:00:22,473
Who had it last?

11
00:00:22,708 --> 00:00:24,545
I used it this afternoon.

12
00:00:24,545 --> 00:00:26,441
Then I put it on the couch.

13
00:00:26,441 --> 00:00:27,743
I think.

14
00:00:27,743 --> 00:00:29,827
Maybe beside the blue cushion.

15
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,781
Maybe the couch ate it.

16
00:00:31,781 --> 00:00:34,073
It eats my pencils all the time.

17
00:00:34,348 --> 00:00:36,456
Let's check one place at a time.

18
00:00:36,456 --> 00:00:38,769
Lucy, look beside the couch.

19
00:00:38,769 --> 00:00:40,998
Ben, check under the cushions.

20
00:00:41,284 --> 00:00:44,642
I find a sock, two building blocks, and a pencil.

21
00:00:44,642 --> 00:00:46,882
The couch clearly has hobbies.

22
00:00:46,882 --> 00:00:49,517
Ben lifts one cushion, then the next.

23
00:00:49,517 --> 00:00:51,226
Still no remote.

24
00:00:51,508 --> 00:00:53,843
Dad, could you move over a little?

25
00:00:54,076 --> 00:00:55,174
Why?

26
00:00:55,174 --> 00:00:57,216
Do you think it's underneath me?

27
00:00:57,484 --> 00:00:59,051
Dad stands up.

28
00:00:59,051 --> 00:01:02,165
There, exactly where he was sitting, is the remote.

29
00:01:02,165 --> 00:01:04,217
Nobody speaks for a second.

30
00:01:04,217 --> 00:01:06,863
Then Ben slowly raises one eyebrow.

31
00:01:07,132 --> 00:01:10,582
We checked almost everywhere except the most suspicious person.

32
00:01:10,804 --> 00:01:13,837
In my defense, it was surprisingly comfortable.

33
00:01:14,068 --> 00:01:16,280
The television finally turns on.

34
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:19,812
After the show, we put the remote in a small tray on the table.

35
00:01:19,812 --> 00:01:22,520
Dad checks his seat before sitting down again.

36
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:26,468
The couch may eat pencils, but tonight we've rescued its biggest snack.
